- `{{ s.key }}` — {{ s.description }}{% endfor %}
{% else %}- Keys are defined by `pc_situation_schema` in the pack (3–5 keys maximum, all `"required": false`).
{% endif %}- Values are short strings describing their current situation for each key.
- Values may include names of people or places. If a person name appears there, use that exact full name for compendium entries.
- **When mentioning family members, always include a full name** (given + {pc.name}'s family name). BAD: "Wife Clara in Morganstead." GOOD: "Wife Clara Vance in Morganstead."
- **All keys marked `"persist": true` MUST always have a value.** Never omit them. If there is no relevant fact, use a placeholder like "None" or "They have no [key]."
